From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:24:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NbtAccounter.accountBytes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

解析时每个 tag 都调用。无限制账户（quota==Long.MAX_VALUE，区块/玩家加载的
主路径）永不触发溢出检查、usage 也从不被读取，故在长加法/比较/分支前短路返回。

diff --git a/net/minecraft/nbt/NbtAccounter.java b/net/minecraft/nbt/NbtAccounter.java
index 9da1ab454a460b65f142f6d751f178fcdfc33667..cc84d5771e8d5d5b838a041f5eda00824fe8eeb6 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/nbt/NbtAccounter.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/nbt/NbtAccounter.java
@@ -39,7 +39,14 @@ public class NbtAccounter {
     public void accountBytes(long bytes) {
         if (bytes < 0L) {
             throw new IllegalArgumentException("Tried to account NBT tag with negative size: " + bytes);
-        } else if (this.usage + bytes > this.quota) {
+        }
+        // Papo start - fast-path unlimited accounters (quota == Long.MAX_VALUE): the overflow
+        // check below can never fire and usage is never read for unlimited accounters.
+        if (this.quota == Long.MAX_VALUE) {
+            return;
+        }
+        // Papo end
+        if (this.usage + bytes > this.quota) {
             throw new NbtAccounterException(
                 "Tried to read NBT tag that was too big; tried to allocate: " + this.usage + " + " + bytes + " bytes where max allowed: " + this.quota
             );
